    <title>Quickstart</title>
    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><anchor id="md_docs_2content_2getting__started_2quickstart_1autotoc_md56"/> This guide shows how to generate and export a heightmap using HighMap.</para>
<sect1 id="md_docs_2content_2getting__started_2quickstart_1autotoc_md57">
<title>1. Example</title>
<para>The following program generates a 2D elevation grid using Perlin fractal Brownian motion (fBm), remaps its values to the interval $[0, 1]$, and writes the result to a 16-bit PNG file.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="preprocessor">#include<sp/>&lt;iostream&gt;</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="preprocessor">#include<sp/>&quot;<ref refid="highmap_8hpp" kindref="compound">highmap.hpp</ref>&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">int</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/><ref refid="main_8cpp_1a3c04138a5bfe5d72780bb7e82a18e627" kindref="member">main</ref>()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>glm::ivec2<sp/><ref refid="elevation__from__contours_8cpp_1af339e609a44f3516574ffecaf5245fa3" kindref="member">shape</ref><sp/>=<sp/>{512,<sp/>512};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>glm::vec2<sp/>res<sp/>=<sp/>{4.0f,<sp/>4.0f};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">int</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>seed<sp/>=<sp/>42;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Generate<sp/>elevation<sp/>data</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><ref refid="classhmap_1_1Array" kindref="compound">hmap::Array</ref><sp/><ref refid="hydraulic__mise_8cpp_1aa14e04bff7de9e968e46a953f71f29f3" kindref="member">z</ref><sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacehmap_1a7d699a468a18be16c70654958ee13b41" kindref="member">hmap::noise_fbm</ref>(<ref refid="namespacehmap_1ab8197c4c7a85dacb616fee7a7d0df195a87c6abee9c8e2441859223b28e9b4581" kindref="member">hmap::NoiseType::PERLIN</ref>,<sp/><ref refid="elevation__from__contours_8cpp_1af339e609a44f3516574ffecaf5245fa3" kindref="member">shape</ref>,<sp/>res,<sp/>seed);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>std::cout<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;min:<sp/>&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/><ref refid="hydraulic__mise_8cpp_1aa14e04bff7de9e968e46a953f71f29f3" kindref="member">z</ref>.min()<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;\n&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>std::cout<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;max:<sp/>&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/><ref refid="hydraulic__mise_8cpp_1aa14e04bff7de9e968e46a953f71f29f3" kindref="member">z</ref>.max()<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;\n&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Remap<sp/>elevation<sp/>values<sp/>to<sp/>[0,<sp/>1]</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><ref refid="hydraulic__mise_8cpp_1aa14e04bff7de9e968e46a953f71f29f3" kindref="member">z</ref>.remap(0.0f,<sp/>1.0f);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Export<sp/>to<sp/>image</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><ref refid="structhmap_1_1ImageWriterConfig" kindref="compound">hmap::ImageWriterConfig</ref><sp/>config;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>config.<ref refid="structhmap_1_1ImageWriterConfig_1a481586b28e6d78db02843fcb819e0583" kindref="member">data_type</ref><sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacehmap_1a451ad02eb796f23b2f68e062e8de9875a48d8f1a723d44ff4a87db1bb6c551c62" kindref="member">hmap::ImageDataType::UINT16</ref>;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><ref refid="namespacehmap_1ae45c9c8f938fb4f94a3a3816d16bcc36" kindref="member">hmap::export_image</ref>(<ref refid="hydraulic__mise_8cpp_1aa14e04bff7de9e968e46a953f71f29f3" kindref="member">z</ref>,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;terrain.png&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>config);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="md_docs_2content_2getting__started_2quickstart_1autotoc_md58">
<title>2. CMake Integration</title>
<para>Link against HighMap using CMake:</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".cmake"><codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake_minimum_required(VERSION<sp/>3.20)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">project(my_project<sp/>CXX)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD<sp/>20)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">find_package(HighMap<sp/>REQUIRED)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">add_executable(my_project<sp/>main.cpp)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">target_link_libraries(my_project<sp/>PRIVATE<sp/>HighMap::HighMap)</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="md_docs_2content_2getting__started_2quickstart_1autotoc_md59">
<title>3. Basic Operations</title>
<para>Common operations on an <computeroutput>Array</computeroutput>:</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>Smoothing</bold>: <programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="hydraulic__mise_8cpp_1aa14e04bff7de9e968e46a953f71f29f3" kindref="member">z</ref><sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacehmap_1ad81052648d6008d2b7b4a5a36a2d7830" kindref="member">hmap::smooth</ref>(<ref refid="hydraulic__mise_8cpp_1aa14e04bff7de9e968e46a953f71f29f3" kindref="member">z</ref>,<sp/>3);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Clamping</bold>: <programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="hydraulic__mise_8cpp_1aa14e04bff7de9e968e46a953f71f29f3" kindref="member">z</ref>.clamp(0.0f,<sp/>1.0f);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Blending</bold>: <programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classhmap_1_1Array" kindref="compound">hmap::Array</ref><sp/>overlay<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="namespacehmap_1a7d699a468a18be16c70654958ee13b41" kindref="member">hmap::noise_fbm</ref>(<ref refid="namespacehmap_1ab8197c4c7a85dacb616fee7a7d0df195a87c6abee9c8e2441859223b28e9b4581" kindref="member">hmap::NoiseType::PERLIN</ref>,<sp/><ref refid="elevation__from__contours_8cpp_1af339e609a44f3516574ffecaf5245fa3" kindref="member">shape</ref>,<sp/>{8.f,<sp/>8.f},<sp/>101);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="hydraulic__mise_8cpp_1aa14e04bff7de9e968e46a953f71f29f3" kindref="member">z</ref><sp/>=<sp/>hmap::blend_max(<ref refid="hydraulic__mise_8cpp_1aa14e04bff7de9e968e46a953f71f29f3" kindref="member">z</ref>,<sp/>overlay<sp/>*<sp/>0.5f);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect1>
